    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<div style="background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-left:5px solid #f7931a;border-radius:8px;padding:18px 22px;margin-bottom:16px;">
<p style="color:#9a3412;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 8px;">S8 Q2 — Decode SIGHASH</p>
<p style="color:#1e293b;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;margin:0;">Base types: 1=ALL, 2=NONE, 3=SINGLE. Bit 0x80 adds the ANYONECANPAY modifier.</p>
</div>
<p style="font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;">Write <strong><code>decode_sighash(flag)</code></strong> that returns the type name. If the <code>0x80</code> bit is set, append <code>"|ANYONECANPAY"</code>. Read the base type from <code>flag &amp; 0x1f</code>.</p>
