<p style="font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;">Write <strong><code>der_extract_r(sig)</code></strong> that returns the integer value of <code>r</code>. The r-length is at index 3 and the r-bytes (big-endian) start at index 4.</p>
